{"id":"b87b214a01dffde2","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-2random-plain-C.md","title":"2 随机性的无穷多次普通不可压缩刻画","display":"thm-2random-plain-C — 2 随机性的无穷多次普通不可压缩刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-2random-plain-C","aliases":["43-thm-2random-plain-C"],"display":"thm-2random-plain-C — 2 随机性的无穷多次普通不可压缩刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-2random]]","[[43-df-kolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7.2 Theorem 9.7.11，印刷194，PDF214","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-2random-plain-C"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-2random-plain-C</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2random-plain-C — 2 随机性的无穷多次普通不可压缩刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7.2 Theorem 9.7.11，印刷194，PDF214"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是固定最优普通复杂度（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c6460737e81fabbf\" href=\"?note=c6460737e81fabbf\" title=\"43-df-2random\">43-df-2random</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge N\\land C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge N\\land C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>源书称右边为Kolmogorov随机性；这是本PDF可精确定位的2随机双向刻画。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7.2 Theorem 9.7.11，印刷194，PDF214。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$C$ 是固定最优普通复杂度（see [[43-df-kolm]]），$\\mathrm{Random}_2$ 见 [[43-df-2random]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-2random","status":"resolved","id":"c6460737e81fabbf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$C$ 是固定最优普通复杂度（see [[43-df-kolm]]），$\\mathrm{Random}_2$ 见 [[43-df-2random]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\ge N\\land C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-c\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1150,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-196","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-2random-plain-C]] — 2 随机性的无穷多次普通不可压缩刻画"}],"outgoing":["c6460737e81fabbf","a0589ee7a1cc12e8"]}